{
  "meta": {
    "url": "https://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/",
    "description": [
      "按操作数的规定转换并格式化，从而复制文件。"
    ]
  },
  "option": [
    {
      "name": "bs",
      "usage": [
        "bs=<BYTES>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "每次读写最多 BYTES 个字节（默认 512）；覆盖 ibs 和 obs"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "1K"
        },
        {
          "name": "1M"
        },
        {
          "name": "512"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "cbs",
      "usage": [
        "cbs=<BYTES>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "每次转换 BYTES 个字节"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "1"
        },
        {
          "name": "1K"
        },
        {
          "name": "512"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "conv",
      "usage": [
        "conv=<CONVS>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "按以逗号分隔的符号列表转换文件"
      ],
      "separator": ",",
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "count",
      "usage": [
        "count=<N>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "只复制 N 个输入块"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "1"
        },
        {
          "name": "10"
        },
        {
          "name": "100"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "ibs",
      "usage": [
        "ibs=<BYTES>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "每次最多读取 BYTES 个字节（默认 512）"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "1K"
        },
        {
          "name": "1M"
        },
        {
          "name": "512"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "if",
      "usage": [
        "if=<FILE>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "从 FILE 读取而不是从 stdin 读取"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "iflag",
      "usage": [
        "iflag=<FLAGS>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "按以逗号分隔的符号列表读取"
      ],
      "separator": ",",
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "obs",
      "usage": [
        "obs=<BYTES>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "每次写入 BYTES 个字节（默认 512）"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "1K"
        },
        {
          "name": "1M"
        },
        {
          "name": "512"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "of",
      "usage": [
        "of=<FILE>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "写入 FILE 而不是标准输出"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "oflag",
      "usage": [
        "oflag=<FLAGS>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "按以逗号分隔的符号列表写入"
      ],
      "separator": ",",
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "seek",
      "usage": [
        "seek=<N>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "（也可写作 oseek=N）跳过 N 个 obs 大小的输出块"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "1"
        },
        {
          "name": "10"
        },
        {
          "name": "100"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "skip",
      "usage": [
        "skip=<N>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "（也可写作 iseek=N）跳过 N 个 ibs 大小的输入块"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "1"
        },
        {
          "name": "10"
        },
        {
          "name": "100"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "status",
      "usage": [
        "status=<LEVEL>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "要打印到标准错误的信息级别；none 除错误信息外什么都不打印，noxfer 抑制最终的传输统计，progress 周期性显示传输统计"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "none"
        },
        {
          "name": "noxfer"
        },
        {
          "name": "progress"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "global_option": [
    {
      "name": "--help",
      "tip": [
        "显示此帮助并退出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--version",
      "tip": [
        "输出版本信息并退出"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
